    thinking: "**Analyzing Chart Data**\n\nI\'ve realized the `ProductCountView` component relies on a `forwardFillMarker` key in the `chartData`, however the current data doesn\'t provide this. This is an intentional omission, and confirms that the marker bar will not render if the key is not present, which is acceptable behavior.\n\n\n**Refining Visualization Details**\n\nI\'m now focusing on the `ForwardFillMarker` implementation for the chart. I\'ve confirmed that the `ForwardFillDot` component is unused and can be safely removed. I\'ve decided to render the marker bar using a bar plot with a `barSize` of 4 and a solid color, specifically `#fb923c`, to ensure it\'s visible even with small data values. I also confirmed that Recharts correctly renders the bar starting from the x-axis with the configured `domain`. I\'m checking if opacity is needed, or if a solid color is more appropriate for visual clarity.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 3
      nanos: 868081751
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
